{"unit_id":"haibinwang9__dsh-web-search#card-zh","repo":"haibinwang9/dsh-web-search","commit":"1444b566335c5461768b1330bb27c3ed0a91a49e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search（DSH 网页客户端插件）：为 DSH 接入多引擎网页搜索与链接正文提取。它向 web seam 注册搜索和抓取 provider，并提供设置页管理开关与凭证。搜索按 SearXNG、Tavily、Brave、DuckDuckGo 顺序回退；还可提取网页 HTML 正文、格式化 JSON 并标记二进制内容。适合需要在 DSH 中检索网页资料并阅读结果链接的用户。可选配置 SearXNG 地址及 Tavily、Brave 凭证；无凭证时仍可尝试 DuckDuckGo。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:183-201","lib/index.js:208-233"]}
{"unit_id":"haibinwang9__dsh-web-search#card-en","repo":"haibinwang9/dsh-web-search","commit":"1444b566335c5461768b1330bb27c3ed0a91a49e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-web-search adds web search and page extraction to DSH's web client. It registers search and fetch providers plus a settings card. Search falls back through SearXNG, Tavily, Brave, then DuckDuckGo. It converts HTML to text and formats JSON. Credentials are optional; DuckDuckGo needs none.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:183-201","lib/index.js:208-233"]}
