{"unit_id":"haibinwang9__dsh-web-search#feature-1","repo":"haibinwang9/dsh-web-search","commit":"1444b566335c5461768b1330bb27c3ed0a91a49e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search 的功能「多引擎网页搜索」：通过 web seam 为内置搜索提供 SearXNG、Tavily、Brave 与 DuckDuckGo 回退链。搜索请求包含查询词，结果返回来源链接、标题和摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:130-145"]}
{"unit_id":"haibinwang9__dsh-web-search#feature-2","repo":"haibinwang9/dsh-web-search","commit":"1444b566335c5461768b1330bb27c3ed0a91a49e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search 的功能「链接正文提取」：调用 get_search_content 并传入 HTTP(S) URL，可返回页面状态与正文；HTML 转纯文本、JSON 美化，二进制内容会提示类型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:208-233"]}
